          },
          "lastSeen": "2026/2/26",
          "fc": null,
          "dictation": null,
          "fcplus": null,
          "reorder": null
        },
        "Which is why I believe the Alchemist continues all these years later to resonate with people from different cultures all around the world, touching them emotionally and spiritually, equally without prejudice.": {
